{
  "_comment": "THE PRISM THEME — the default UI theme COLORS and nothing else (five-line architecture, Aaron 2026-08-12): `theme.tokens` is the ONE palette every $token ref in every style source (ui_style.json, ui_stages.json, scene-file `styles`, vendored bench styles) resolves against. Weights/effects live in ui_style.json; a scene's own values live in its .scene.json; component structure is Rust drawing code. Adding ANY other node to this file is the violation the theme-only gate exists to catch.",
